OL,3,ABurnham and Badenoch clash over UK
OL,4,Agovernment borrowing and North Sea
OL,5,Adrilling approval
OL,6,
OL,7,FAndy Burnham and Kemi Badenoch have
OL,8,Fclashed over oil and gas licences, and
OL,9,Fthe public finances, at Prime
OL,10,FMinister's Questions
OL,12,FBadenoch began by asking Burnham if the
OL,13,Fgovernment will overturn Labour's
OL,14,Fmanifesto commitment not to grant new
OL,15,Ffossil fuel licences
OL,17,FThis morning, the government announced
OL,18,Fit was approving the Jackdaw gas field
OL,19,F- where a licence was granted in 2022,
OL,20,Fbefore being delayed in the courts
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
