OL,3,ABurnham and Badenoch clash over UK
OL,4,Agovernment borrowing and North Sea
OL,5,Adrilling approval
OL,6,
OL,7,FBurnham says his government was fixing
OL,8,Fa decision the Conservative government
OL,9,Fhad "messed up"
OL,11,FBadenoch also presses Burnham on UK
OL,12,Fpublic sector debt, which passed #3tn
OL,13,Ftoday - she calls on the PM to cut the
OL,14,Fwelfare bill
OL,16,FThe prime minister cites the IMF, which
OL,17,Frecently praised the UK's efforts to
OL,18,Freduce the deficit - and questions how
OL,19,FConservatives have the "audacity" to
OL,20,F"lecture us about how to do a Budget"
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
